msgid "Hazard Categories"
msgstr "样品属性"

msgid "scope_reference_only"
msgstr "仅参考物质"

msgid "scope_ar_only"
msgstr "仅请验单"

msgid "scope_both"
msgstr "两者（参考+请验单）"

msgid "heading_hazard_categories"
msgstr "样品属性"

msgid "description_hazard_categories_maintenance"
msgstr "维护 Reference Definition / Reference Sample 中可勾选的 Hazard categories 列表。点击<strong>「+ 新增一行」</strong>添加记录，直接在表格内编辑各字段。修改后点击每行的<strong>「保存」</strong>或上方的<strong>「保存所有更改」</strong>。每行字段含义：<code>CODE</code> 编号（唯一）、<code>Name</code> 英文名称、<code>Common</code> 通用名、<code>Pictogram</code> 图标路径。"

msgid "Hazard categories"
msgstr "样品属性"

msgid "每行一条，格式为：CODE|Name|Common|pictogram-path 。修改后立即生效，Reference Definition / Reference Sample 里的 Hazard categories 候选项会直接从这份配置读取。"
msgstr "每行一条，格式为：CODE|Name|Common|pictogram-path。修改后立即生效，Reference Definition / Reference Sample 里的 Hazard categories 候选项会直接从这份配置读取。"

msgid "Hazard categories (JSON)"
msgstr "样品属性（JSON）"

msgid "按行存储的结构化 Hazard categories JSON 列表。每行包含 uid/code/name/common/pictogram 字段。由数据表维护界面自动生成，与 categories 文本字段双向同步。不要手动修改此字段。"
msgstr "按行存储的结构化 Hazard categories JSON 列表。每行包含 uid/code/name/common/pictogram 字段。由数据表维护界面自动生成，与 categories 文本字段双向同步。请不要手动修改此字段。"

msgid "CODE"
msgstr "编码"

msgid "Unique category code, e.g. GHS01, BIO01"
msgstr "唯一分类编码，例如 GHS01、BIO01"

msgid "Name (English)"
msgstr "名称（英文）"

msgid "English name, e.g. Explosive"
msgstr "英文名称，例如 Explosive"

msgid "Common name / Chinese"
msgstr "通用名 / 中文名"

msgid "Common or localised name, e.g. explosive / 爆炸性"
msgstr "通用或本地化名称，例如 explosive / 爆炸性"

msgid "Pictogram path"
msgstr "图标路径"

msgid "Path relative to the portal, e.g. ghs/GHS01.svg or iso/W009.svg"
msgstr "相对门户的路径，例如 ghs/GHS01.svg 或 iso/W009.svg"

msgid "Usage scope"
msgstr "应用范围"

msgid "Where this category should appear: Reference Definition only, AR (Analysis Request / 请验单) only, or Both."
msgstr "此分类显示位置：仅参考物质定义、仅请验单或两者都显示。"

